### Distributed Queue System - REST API Request Collection & Curl Cheatsheet
### Host: http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
# curl -i http://localhost:3000/health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### 2. Queue Statistics
# curl -i http://localhost:3000/queues/stats
GET http://localhost:3000/queues/stats

###

### 3. Submit a Normal Priority Job
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs \
#   -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#   -d '{"type":"demo-task","data":{"taskName":"Generate Report","records":150},"priority":5,"maxRetries":3}'
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "demo-task",
  "data": {
    "taskName": "Generate Report",
    "records": 150
  },
  "priority": 5,
  "maxRetries": 3
}

###

### 4. Submit a High-Priority Job (Priority 10)
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs \
#   -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#   -d '{"type":"demo-task","data":{"taskName":"Security Alert Delivery","urgency":"critical"},"priority":10,"maxRetries":3}'
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "demo-task",
  "data": {
    "taskName": "Security Alert Delivery",
    "urgency": "critical"
  },
  "priority": 10,
  "maxRetries": 3
}

###

### 5. Submit a Failing Job (shouldFail = true)
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs \
#   -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#   -d '{"type":"demo-task","data":{"taskName":"Payment Processing Failure","shouldFail":true},"priority":7,"maxRetries":2}'
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "demo-task",
  "data": {
    "taskName": "Payment Processing Failure",
    "shouldFail": true
  },
  "priority": 7,
  "maxRetries": 2
}

###

### 6. Submit Invalid Job (Validation Error Test - Missing Data)
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs \
#   -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#   -d '{"type":"demo-task","priority":15}'
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "demo-task",
  "priority": 15
}

###

### 7. Get Job Details by ID (Replace <JOB_ID> with an actual job ID)
# curl -i http://localhost:3000/jobs/<JOB_ID>
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs/ba88b559-6213-45de-a0fd-dbca6282a37b

###

### 8. List All Jobs (Default Pagination: limit=20, offset=0)
# curl -i "http://localhost:3000/jobs?limit=10&offset=0"
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?limit=10&offset=0

###

### 9. List Jobs Filtered by Status (e.g. pending, completed, processing, dead)
# curl -i "http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=completed&limit=5"
GET http://localhost:3000/jobs?status=completed&limit=5

###

### 10. Cancel a Pending Job (Replace <PENDING_JOB_ID>)
# curl -i -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/jobs/<PENDING_JOB_ID>
DELETE http://localhost:3000/jobs/some-pending-job-id

###

### 11. Retry a Dead Job from DLQ (via /jobs route)
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/<DEAD_JOB_ID>/retry
POST http://localhost:3000/jobs/some-dead-job-id/retry

###

### 12. List Dead-Letter Queue (DLQ) Jobs (Paginated, most recent first)
# curl -i "http://localhost:3000/dlq?limit=10&offset=0"
GET http://localhost:3000/dlq?limit=10&offset=0

###

### 13. Retry a DLQ Job (via /dlq route)
# curl -i -X POST http://localhost:3000/dlq/<DEAD_JOB_ID>/retry
POST http://localhost:3000/dlq/some-dead-job-id/retry

###

### 14. Permanently Purge a Job from DLQ
# curl -i -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/dlq/<DEAD_JOB_ID>
DELETE http://localhost:3000/dlq/some-dead-job-id
